/* French wording for the French pages, kept beside the English it translates.
 *
 * How to edit
 * - Left: the English exactly as it appears on the English page. Right: the French.
 * - Numbers on the left are matched as "any number": write {0}, {1}… on the right where the
 *   English numbers go, and the build copies them from the English page (4.92 → 4,92,
 *   2,006 → 2 006). A French wording without {0} is only used while the English numbers stay
 *   the same; if they change, the build stops and asks for an update.
 * - French spacing before : ; ! ? % and inside « » is added automatically.
 * - Apartment, brand and guest names are kept as they are (see KEEP).
 * - If you reword an English sentence, rebuild: the build lists any English that has no French
 *   so you can add it here.
 */
